#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-store-pages-ui.php:53
msgid "WooCommerce store pages are translated to all the site's languages."
msgstr "تمت ترجمة صفحات متجر WooCommerce إلى جميع لغات الموقع."

#. translators: Heading of the block on the Status screen that counts untranslated product categories, tags and attributes.
#: inc/template-classes/status/class-wcml-status-taxonomies-ui.php:27
